    shellable complexes
  * *note idealChainFromShelling: idealChainFromShelling, -- Produces chains of
    ideals from a shelling.
  * *note idealFromShelling: idealFromShelling, -- Produces an ideal from a
    shelling

Ways to use randomAddition:
===========================

  * "randomAddition(Ring,ZZ,List)"
  * "randomAddition(ZZ,ZZ,List)"

